    "intro_html":  "Stroganoff is what happens when mushrooms, butter, and sour cream decide to make pork look fancy. This one delivers \u003cstrong\u003e{{protein}} grams of protein\u003c/strong\u003e per bowl over wide egg noodles, and it costs about \u003cstrong\u003e${{cost_ps}} a serving\u003c/strong\u003e (at everyday cost). Comfort food math that actually works in your favor.",
